T*
(PROCEDURES) Tj
T*
(========================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2.3: ENTERPRISE UPTIME SLA & SERVICE CREDIT SCHEDULE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TitanCloud guarantees a 99.95% monthly uptime Service Level Agreement \(SLA\) across) Tj
T*
(all production multi-AZ clusters. If monthly uptime drops below the threshold,) Tj
T*
(enterprise customers are owed the following SLA service credit percentages applied) Tj
T*
(against their monthly cluster invoice:) Tj
T*
(- 99.50% to 99.94% uptime: 10% service credit) Tj
T*
(- 99.00% to 99.49% uptime \(including 99.2%\): 25% service credit) Tj
T*
(- Below 99.00% uptime: 50% service credit) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-2-09\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'TitanCloud Enterprise SRE & Incident Response Runbook' must) Tj
T*
(verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 9 above. Any) Tj
T*
(deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires formal) Tj
T*
(written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
