(CHAPTER 3 | MODULE 22.0: MULTI-REGION BGP ANYCAST INGRESS ROUTING AND DDOS) Tj
T*
(SCRUBBING) Tj
T*
(========================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 5.4: RUNBOOK FOR ERROR CODE ERR_PG_REPLICA_LAG) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Alert Signature: ERR_PG_REPLICA_LAG indicates write-ahead log \(WAL\) replay delay) Tj
T*
(between the primary PostgreSQL node and synchronous standby replicas.) Tj
T*
(AUTOMATIC FAILOVER THRESHOLD: The maximum permitted replication lag threshold is) Tj
T*
(strictly 45 seconds. If replication lag exceeds 45 seconds across three) Tj
T*
(consecutive 5-second health probes, the Patroni consensus controller automatically) Tj
T*
(fences the degraded node and initiates failover to the healthy standby.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-2-22\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'TitanCloud Enterprise SRE & Incident Response Runbook' must) Tj
T*
(verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 22 above. Any) Tj
T*
(deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires formal) Tj
T*
(written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
50 35 Td (Page 22 of 50 | Confidential Assessment Corpus - Do Not Distribute) Tj
ET
