T*
(========================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 9.1: SEVERITY-1 \(P0\) ON-CALL ACKNOWLEDGEMENT & ESCALATION TIMELINE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(When a Severity-1 \(P0\) production outage alert triggers in PagerDuty:) Tj
T*
(1. The L1 On-Call Engineer has a maximum of 5 minutes to acknowledge the alert.) Tj
T*
(2. If unacknowledged at the 5-minute mark, PagerDuty pages the L2 Staff SRE Lead.) Tj
T*
(3. If the alert remains unacknowledged for 15 minutes total \(10 minutes after L2) Tj
T*
(page\), it automatically escalates to the VP of Infrastructure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-2-41\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'TitanCloud Enterprise SRE & Incident Response Runbook' must) Tj
T*
(verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page 41 above. Any) Tj
T*
(deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section requires formal) Tj
T*
(written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
50 35 Td (Page 41 of 50 | Confidential Assessment Corpus - Do Not Distribute) Tj
